            {
              "id": "a3140243-414b-406e-88f6-abd3f0de8ea4",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Leisure &amp; Positive Psychology: Linking Activities with Positiveness</strong></em> was written by Robert A. Stebbins, published by Palgrave Macmillan, September 24, 2015."
            },
            {
              "id": "7cb49a29-4ab1-498f-84ba-d0ecb577ca12",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "88ee726f-ae87-4cc6-9924-e84e2c72f77e",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>This book explores, from a leisure studies perspective, the central role that leisure has to play in positive psychology, exploring themes such as flow, fulfilment, altruism, well-being, and interpersonal relationships.</em>"
            },
